      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing profound exhaustion and feeling completely dehumanized by the demands of your job. Please know that those feelings of worthlessness are symptoms of burnout, not facts about your intrinsic value. If these feelings of hopelessness become overwhelming, reaching out to a crisis hotline like 988 is a vital first step to find immediate support. You matter, and there are people who want to listen.",
